  "description": "Looking for a typeface that packs a punch of personality? Comic Beacon is your go-to bold comic font designed to light up your creative projects with retro charm and playful energy. With its thick strokes, dynamic curves, and expressive forms, this display font is perfect for making a statement, loud and clear.\nWhether you’re designing a comic book, creating pop art-inspired visuals, crafting standout logos, or elevating your merchandise, Comic Beacon brings that nostalgic yet modern feel to the table. It’s a great fit for retro posters, colorful social media graphics, billboards, and more.\nOptimized for readability and impact, Comic Beacon delivers the bold, fun aesthetic that captures attention and keeps the vibe upbeat. It’s more than just a font—it’s a visual voice for your most daring ideas.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Looking for a typeface that packs a punch of personality? Comic Beacon is your go-to bold comic font designed to light up your creative projects with retro charm and playful energy. With its thick strokes, dynamic curves, and expressive forms, this display font is perfect for making a statement, loud and clear.</p>\n<p>Whether you’re designing a comic book, creating pop art-inspired visuals, crafting standout logos, or elevating your merchandise, Comic Beacon brings that nostalgic yet modern feel to the table. It’s a great fit for retro posters, colorful social media graphics, billboards, and more.</p>\n<p>Optimized for readability and impact, Comic Beacon delivers the bold, fun aesthetic that captures attention and keeps the vibe upbeat. It’s more than just a font—it’s a visual voice for your most daring ideas.</p>",
